<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy" updated="October 27, 2026">
  <div class="legal__sec">
    <p><b>This Privacy Notice sets out how The Profectus Agency (“we”, “our”, “us”, “Profectus”) collects, uses, discloses, and protects any Personal Data through this website and its subpages (“Website”)</b>. This Privacy Notice also explains the measures we take to safeguard your Personal Data and describes how you may contact us regarding our privacy practices.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="legal__sec">
    <h2>Introduction</h2>
    <p>Our website is intended to provide information to business clients about our products and services, potential applicants who are interested in a career with Profectus, and website visitors utilizing our <a href="/do-not-sell">privacy portal</a>.</p>
    <p>For purposes of this Privacy Notice, when information identifies or is reasonably capable of being associated with, or could reasonably be linked, directly or indirectly, with you or your household, we refer to it as “Personal Data.” Any Personal Data collected through this Website will only be used for the purposes set out in this Privacy Notice. Notwithstanding anything else in this Privacy Notice, we may use information that does not identify you (including information that has been aggregated or de-identified) for any purpose except as prohibited by applicable law.</p>
    <p><b>Please read this Privacy Notice thoroughly.</b> <b>If you disagree with the way your Personal Data will be used, please do not use this Website. For our Canadian users, your use of the Website constitutes your implied consent for us to process your Personal Data for the BELOW-noted purposes.</b></p>
    <p>We may include links to other websites, including social media platforms. This Privacy Notice only covers this Website and does not apply to the data practices of other websites. We encourage you to read the privacy notices available on other websites you visit.</p>
    <p>This Privacy Notice does not cover employee data or data collected during the application process. If you are an employee, please contact your local human resources office. If you are an applicant, please see our applicant Privacy Policy contained in the recruitment platform.</p>
  </div>
